      "en": "A long white robe was given to each of them. They were told that they should rest yet for a while, until their fellow servants and their brothers, who would also be killed even as they were, should complete their course.",
      "ko": "각각 저희에게 흰 두루마기를 주시며 가라사대 아직 잠시 동안 쉬되 저희 동무 종들과 형제들도 자기처럼 죽임을 받아 그 수가 차기까지 하라 하시더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e0e68389bf9596e8e8d9cd6c61ae8b511dec804113a348316f9562fcfcd7e849",
      "translation_text_hash": "c8c6b316b830d1c0c8a80053464f325eeb2505e8ff099bc4797192207ba6105a",
